* Two-terminal gel-battery Thevenin model for Qucs-S / ngspice
* SUBCKT order:
*   Pin 1 = P  (battery positive)
*   Pin 2 = N  (battery negative)
*
* VOC represents open-circuit voltage / state of charge.
* RBAT represents battery internal resistance.
*
.SUBCKT GEL_BAT P N PARAMS: VOC=13.75 RBAT=0.2
R_INT P BAT_INT {RBAT}
V_OC BAT_INT N DC {VOC}
.ENDS GEL_BAT
